cmm_wpa.c is pristine. SCE.patch selects the PBKDF2 block without building
the unrelated driver, specializes Sony's five-argument fixed-4096 interface,
and adds the observed printable-password validation. The algorithm's original
copy and XOR loops are unchanged. The module adapter maps its HMAC and bounded
string reads to Sony's kernel services. The existing Sony password wrapper is
separate. Configure applies the patch to a build-directory copy only.
